Fabr
Copyright 2026 GoobersAlley

Fabr is a modified fork of Bevy, https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy, which is
licensed under MIT OR Apache-2.0. The engine crates in this repository are
derived from Bevy and have been changed: they are renamed to `eme_*`, the
rendering, asset and platform layers were reduced to what the editor uses, and
an editor, an export path and a scripting layer (Rust, Lua, C#) were added.

Upstream copyright notices are retained in LICENSE-MIT, LICENSE-APACHE and
CREDITS.md. Licenses of third-party dependencies are listed in
THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md.
